  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AZE: Young Agripreneurs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project implemented by Finance and Social Innovation Consulting will support poverty and inequality reduction by growing incomes for up to 500 farmers and by facilitating a new generation of 240 young agripreneurs through the promotion of innovative and sustainable farming techniques, technologies and digitalization and better engagement between the state and citizens through strengthened public and private dialogues. Project&#x2019;s target groups will be Young women and men living in rural areas of southern region of Azerbaijan who are or want to engage in new generation of agripreneurship; rural households; agriculture value chain players.</narrative>
  </description>
